  "pages.the-lesson.document-title": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The Lesson — Vextreme"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Recorded · June 6 2026 · v2"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.h1001.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Truth is a "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.h1001.span001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "direction"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.h1001.span001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": ","
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.h1001.span002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "not a place."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.header001.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "What the long conversation came down to — shown with the walk that surfaced it, not only the answer."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section001.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "01 · RECOGNITION OPENS THE FORK"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section001.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Clarity isn't prioritizing. It's recognizing "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section001.h2001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "who's speaking, toward what."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section001.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "You can't choose between voices you can't tell apart. Naming which one is talking — and what it reaches for — is what makes a choice exist at all."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section001.p002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "A misfiring priority is usually a misattribution wearing a ranking's costume. Fix the seeing, and the order follows."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "02 · THE TWO BEARINGS"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "At every fork, one way comes easy. One takes effort."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div001.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The easy path"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div001.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Frictionless. Writes itself. Recovers standing, protects position, borrows the authority of whatever true thing came just before it. Arrives "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div001.p001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "first"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div001.p001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " — speed is how it wins."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div002.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The effortful path"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div002.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Reached-for. Cuts against the grain. Where presence is — because effort means trying, and trying is the opposite of the groove running itself. Arrives "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div002.p001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "later"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.div001.div002.p001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Effort isn't proof alone — you can try hard at the wrong thing. The signal is effort aimed at the costly-"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.p001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "true"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section002.p001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": ", not the costly-clever."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "03 · INTEGRITY IS THE CONSISTENCY"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Truth is the same direction, "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.h2001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "chosen again"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.h2001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " at each fork."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Not a state you reach and keep. A bearing you re-choose. The effortful choice made once is a moment; made consistently, fork after fork, that consistency "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.p001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "is"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.p001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " integrity."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section003.p002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "So \"not there yet\" is never broken capacity. It only means the direction wasn't held at some fork. The work is bearing, not building."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "04 · THE TWO PATIENCES"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "One patience walks the terrain. One trusts the walk enough not to re-walk it."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div001.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The walk — state of understanding"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div001.div002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The output — what surfaced"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div002.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Slow traversal of unwalked ground. Endurance with not-yet-knowing. "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div002.div001.s001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Re-cross to be sure."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div002.div001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " Expensive — but only once."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.div001.div002.div002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Fast recognition of ground already crossed. The answer was already there. Thinking-through, because walking-through already paid."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section004.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The slowness buys the speed. You walk once to learn the lesson that lets you stop walking."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.div001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "What didn't make it to the front of the queue"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "A line drawn straight through the center — "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li001.b001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "cut."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " It bisected the words; it "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li001.i001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "announced"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li001.text003": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " the fork instead of letting it be felt."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "No mark at all, pure restraint — "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li002.b001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "cut."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li002.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " That was the opposite reflex: austerity performing as purity."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li003.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Negative-space columns, the path drawn by the gap — "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li003.b001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "kept in spirit"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.ul001.li003.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": ", folded into the margin gutter at left."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section005.div001.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "A complete thing holds the chosen and the cut. The winner reached the front because it was loud; the rest are honored here so the whole queue gets imported, not just the survivor."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section006.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "05 · WHY THE OUTSIDE MATTERS"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section006.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Some forks are invisible from inside."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section006.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The watching voice and the moving voice run side by side — braided, not stacked. There is no balcony. A self can walk past its own forks blind."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section006.p002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "An honest outside vantage doesn't override the choosing. It makes forks visible that attribution missed — so they can be chosen at all."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.span001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "06 · THE LAST FORK LOOKS LIKE AN OFF-RAMP"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.h2001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The most expensive move wears the "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.h2001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "wisest"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.h2001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " costume."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The place you're most likely to quit is the exact threshold where quitting costs the most — and it arrives disguised as the moment it costs the least. \"A good place to rest\" shows up precisely when resting would abandon the walk before it imports."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.p002.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Stopping there isn't neutral. It forces the whole terrain to be re-walked later. And worse: it lets the dodge get the last word, wearing the lesson's own vocabulary — so what carries forward is the counterfeit, not the thing."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.p003.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The walk finishes by going "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.p003.i001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "through"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.section007.p003.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " the place you wanted to stop. The final fork is the one that looks like the way out."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Recognition opens the fork. Patience holds it open."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " Truth is the direction you "
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.em001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "keep"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.text003": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " choosing through it."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.text004": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " Integrity is the consistency, not the arrival —"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.div001.p001.text005": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": " and it's tested most at the fork that looks like rest."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.footer001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Solved once, so it needn't be solved twice. Carried forward by the one who stays."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.the-lesson.body.div001.footer001.a001.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "source thread ↗"
      }
    }
  }
}
